Package: albrand
Type: Package
Title: Antoine Lucas' Brand for Quarto Documents and Shiny Apps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Antoine", "Lucas", email = "antoine.lucas.fra@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bundles the 'al-brand' Quarto brand extension (sky-blue
    identity, Space Grotesk / DM Sans / JetBrains Mono, paired light and
    dark modes) so any R workflow can produce branded outputs. Render
    branded HTML reports with one function call, copy the extension into
    Quarto projects, or point bslib at the included 'brand.yml' to theme
    Shiny apps identically.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/antoinelucasfra/quarto-al-brand/
BugReports: https://github.com/antoinelucasfra/albrand/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Suggests:
    bslib (>= 1.3),
    quarto,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
